5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since it's the first day, we don't have any information yet. Let's see if anyone wants to speak up or share their initial thoughts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really know what to say yet. I'm just a bit nervous.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"We should focus on observing everyone's behavior and speech patterns. Since there is no one to vote for today, let's use this time to gauge who seems unnatural.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Asuka. Since we lack concrete evidence, analyzing the logic and consistency of our arguments will be the most reliable method for identifying the werewolf.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit scary, but I'll do my best to help everyone. Let's try to keep the atmosphere friendly while we figure this out together.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Does anyone have a specific strategy they'd like to suggest for the coming days, or should we just continue observing for now?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Maybe... we should just listen to each other? I'm not good at this, but I think we should be careful not to accuse people too quickly.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Daisuke on avoiding hasty accusations. However, we must be mindful that the Possessed will likely try to blend in and steer us away from the Werewolf. We need to be vigilant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a valid point, Asuka. The Possessed will likely act as a shield for the Werewolf, so we should pay close attention to who is defending whom too aggressively.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I'll try my best to be honest and helpful. I hope we can all trust each other and find the werewolf without any unnecessary fighting.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I think we've established a basic approach. Since we're just observing today, does anyone feel like someone's tone is already suspicious, or is it too early to tell?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't think I can tell yet. Everyone seems so calm, and I'm too scared to guess wrong.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"It is indeed too early for definitive conclusions. However, I am curious to see how people react once the first night's results are revealed tomorrow.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,The reactions to the first death will be the most telling. The Werewolf and the Possessed will likely try to manipulate the narrative to shift suspicion onto an innocent villager.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I hope it doesn't come to that. But if we stay calm and listen to each other, I'm sure we can find the truth together.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Since we've reached the end of the first day, let's just keep these points in mind. I'll see you all tomorrow morning.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Good night, everyone. I hope... I hope nothing bad happens tonight.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Good night. Let's all try to stay focused and observant. I'll see you tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Good night. I will be analyzing the information we gather tomorrow with a critical eye.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. Please get some rest, and let's all be safe tonight.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
